  "cards": [
    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "One message, end to end", "items": [
      "The first node loads the active Brand Profile; the Query Handler makes a routing decision: chat, unclear, new_content or refine",
      "New content becomes a plan; research and the Strategist go first when the Topic has no Research Brief (ADR 0001)",
      "The Dispatcher runs each step's agent; an agent can stop the plan with an abort reason, which is posted in the chat"
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Quality and Brand Profiles", "items": [
      "Writers run the quality loop: draft, rule checks, AI review, then up to the configured revisions; the best Attempt becomes a Revision",
      "The Quality Score is 70 points of checks and 30 of the reviewer's engagement and brand-voice scores",
      "Every Revision records the Brand Profile it was made with; images use its visual style and fall back to a placeholder card"
    ] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Ops", "items": [
      "GitHub Actions: CI (lint, tests, Docker build), then deploy to Azure Container Apps on main",
      "Conversation state is in memory, so the app runs as one replica (ADR 0003); Brand Profiles and images persist on the /data mount",
      "LangSmith tracing is opt-in through a LiteLLM callback; model and fallback choices live in models.yaml (ADR 0002)"
    ] }
  ]
